eczos-boot-tools (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Detect UEFI/BIOS mode, firmware entries and other operating systems.
  * Validate discovered block devices and EFI boot files before presenting them.
  * Add an authenticated transactional GRUB menu refresh with backup, syntax
    validation, verification and rollback.
  * Never change EFI boot order or reinstall a bootloader.

